OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJudge temporarily overturns Trump's
OL,4,AWhite House media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three outlets launched a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge after their reporters had
OL,8,Ftheir passes for the White House
OL,9,Fconfiscated and were denied access.
OL,11,FThe Trump administration defended the
OL,12,Fmove in court, accusing the outlets of
OL,13,Fpublishing false information and
OL,14,Fthreatening national security - an
OL,15,Fargument the court rejected.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
